stats":[71,60,71,64,75,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[71,60,71,64,75,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,60,71,64,75,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"4250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[71,60,71,64,75,54],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,60,71,64,75,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"80","reputation":"3650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国官臣，步骘之子，步骘和兄长步协去世后继任西陵督。后因拒绝遵从离开西陵的命令，便举城投向晋国。吴便遣陆抗前去进攻西陵，最终步阐被迫而降，回吴后与部下皆被处刑。","tc":"吳國官臣，步騭之子，步騭和兄長步協去世后繼任西陵督。后因拒絕遵從離開西陵的命令，便舉城投向晉國。吳便遣陸抗前去進攻西陵，最終步闡被迫而降，回吳后與部下皆被處刑。","en":"An official of Wu and son of Bu Zhi. After Bu Zhi and his elder brother Bu Xie both died, he succeeded as Commander of Xiling. When he refused an order to leave Xiling, he surrendered the city to Jin. Wu dispatched Lu Kang to attack Xiling, and Bu Chan was ultimately cornered into submission. Upon his return to Wu, he and his subordinates were all executed.","jp":"呉の臣で、歩騭の子。歩騭と兄の歩協の死後、西陵督を継ぐ。後に西陵を離れる命を拒み、城ごと晋に降った。呉は陸抗を派遣して西陵を攻めさせ、最終的に歩闡は降伏を余儀なくされ、呉に戻された後に部下とともに処刑された。","kr":"오나라의 신하이자 보즐의 아들입니다. 보즐과 형 보협이 세상을 떠난 뒤 서릉독 자리를 계승했습니다. 이후 서릉을 떠나라는 명을 거부하고 성을 들어 진나라에 투항했습니다. 이에 오나라가 육항을 파견하여 서릉을 공격하자, 결국 보천은 굴복하여 항복할 수밖에 없었고 오나라로 압송된 뒤 부하들과 함께 모두 처형당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10479","remark":"","surname":"步","surnameTc":"步","surnameEn":"Bu","surnameJp":"歩","surnameKr":"보","surnameOther":"","name":"阐","nameTc":"闡","nameEn":"Chan","nameJp":"闡","nameKr":"천","nameOther":"","word":"仲思","wordTc":"仲思","wordEn":"Zhongsi","wordJp":"仲思","wordKr":"중사","wordOther":"","icon":"步阐","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"236","city":"CS1057","gender":"0","rule":"71","force":"60","wise":"71","politics":"64","charm":"75","will":"54","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"23/23/23/23/23/71/43/23","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"3600","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001405","professions":"3/0/0/2/0/3/2/1/1/0/2/2/3/0/0/0/4/3/3/1/0/1/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"86","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3650","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"222","show":"236","death":"272","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013805","he